  "intro": {
    "text": "A *lokanta* is a simple restaurant with home-style dishes. Menus are full of compounds named after a place or an ingredient: *Adana kebabı*, *mercimek çorbası*. To compare orders, use `-ki`: *Benimki acı, seninki değil* (Mine is spicy, yours isn't).",
    "see": "gp-ki-pronoun"
  },
